G="Unity without justice, said plainly"
E=[(G,296,"Where some members are owed and never given their due, the bond is not communion but exploitation wearing the costume of togetherness—the \"unity\" of a cartel, of insiders who cover for one another, of a marriage in which one spouse's needs are perpetually sacrificed to the other's comfort.","Where some members are treated unfairly—denied the fair pay, honest dealing, respect or care that justice says is theirs—what looks like communion is really some people using others: the \"unity\" of a cartel, of insiders who cover for one another, of a marriage in which one spouse's needs are always sacrificed to the other's comfort.")]
